<% provide(:title, "Accessibility") %>

<div class="container py-5">
  <div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-9">
      <h1 class="h2 mb-3">Accessibility Statement</h1>

      <div class="alert alert-warning mb-4" role="note">
        <strong>Compliance status: Not formally audited.</strong>
        ShareMyBag Exchange is engineered following <strong>RGAA 4.1</strong> and <strong>WCAG 2.1 Level AA</strong> technical guidelines, but has not yet undergone a formal third-party accessibility audit grid required to claim official RGAA compliance.
      </div>

      <div class="d-grid gap-4">
        <section class="smb-card p-4">
          <h2 class="h5 mb-2">Accessibility Practices Implemented</h2>
          <ul class="text-muted small mb-0 d-grid gap-2">
            <li><strong>Language &amp; Landmarks</strong>: Explicit <code>lang="en"</code>, skip link directly to <code>#main-content</code>, semantic <code>header</code>, <code>nav[aria-label]</code>, <code>main</code>, <code>footer</code>, and a single <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code> per page.</li>
            <li><strong>Non-Color Signifiers</strong>: Buy/Sell prices, margins, and statuses never rely on color alone — explicit prefixes (<code>BID</code>, <code>ASK</code>, <code>+</code>, <code>−</code>, <code>Open</code>, <code>Cutoff</code>) accompany every figure.</li>
            <li><strong>Accessible Data Tables &amp; Mobile Tabs</strong>: Semantic <code>&lt;table&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;caption&gt;</code>, and <code>&lt;th scope="col"&gt;</code> headers on desktop, collapsing into labeled stacked cards under 640 px and keyboard-accessible <code>role="tablist"</code> Buy/Sell tabs on narrow screens.</li>
            <li><strong>Forms &amp; Live Regions</strong>: Explicit labels, <code>&lt;fieldset&gt;</code>/<code>&lt;legend&gt;</code>, <code>aria-required</code>, <code>aria-invalid</code>, focusable error summaries (<code>role="alert"</code>), and polite live regions (<code>aria-live="polite"</code>) for order and fleet ROI calculators.</li>
            <li><strong>Keyboard Focus &amp; Reduced Motion</strong>: Visible <code>:focus-visible</code> outlines and <code>prefers-reduced-motion: reduce</code> support.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="smb-card p-4">
          <h2 class="h5 mb-2">Automated Checks vs Formal Audit</h2>
          <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
            Automated integration tests check document language, landmarks, heading hierarchy, table scopes, form error states, and live regions on every build. A full manual screen-reader and RGAA 4.1 grid audit remains scheduled prior to carrier production deployment.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
